        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Finding the invitation and completing timed Order Hall missions are the main delays.\n\n1. Establish your Legion Order Hall and progress the Nightfallen introduction in Suramar to Shal'Aran. Unlock Legion world quests through Uniting the Isles and the Withered Army Training activity through Thalyssra's story.\n\n2. Look for Torn Invitation in Nightfallen emissary rewards and the final Withered Army Training reward chest. Repeat those eligible rewards when available; neither an ordinary fox kill nor buying Nightfallen reputation guarantees an invitation.\n\n3. Use Torn Invitation to accept A Noble Event. At your Legion mission table complete the four fox-hunt missions to recover the List of Invited Nobles, Fox Hunt Invitation, Fox Hunt Net and Fox Hunt Map. Keep Order Resources and available champions for the missions; claim their results at the table.\n\n4. Accept Volpin the Elusive. Travel to the Feathermane Hunting Grounds in Suramar and defeat Herald Gevedaun at 17.7,31.1 before looking for the fox.\n\n5. Find Volpin under the tree near 30.1,35.4, defend him against the hunters and interact with him to calm him. Complete the quest and learn Reins of the Llothien Prowler.",
