        sourceType = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 10,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Controlled boss mechanics, multi-kill criteria and coordination are harder than the legacy combat.\n\n1. Enter The Emerald Nightmare in Val'sharah on Normal or higher. For Nythendra, squash 15 Glow Bugs before finishing Buggy Fight. At Ursoc activate/protect Tur Ragepaw and keep him alive for Scare Bear.\n\n2. At Elerethe Renferal destroy every Pulsing Egg Sac during the fight for Webbing Crashers. For Il'gynoth, gather enough Nightmare Ichors and arrange 20 Nightmare Explosions on the Eye within ten seconds before finishing Took the Red Eye Down.\n\n3. At the Dragons of Nightmare, make every participant collect Dream Essence at all four gateways before defeating Ysondre for Imagined Dragons World Tour. At Cenarius complete each uncleansed-force variation for Use the Force(s); different force conditions can need additional kills.\n\n4. At Xavius expose and kill one Creature in the Dark in each phase (above 65%, 65-30%, below 30%). A Demon Hunter can locate them in the darkness with Spectral Sight and tag them into the arena; a Warlock's detection tools are another option. Kill all three before finishing I Attack the Darkness.\n\n5. Enter The Nighthold in Suramar. Keep everyone in Skorpyron's central rings for Cage Rematch, activate every Nightwell spotlight during Chronomatic Anomaly for Grand Opening, and eat no more than 20 Toxic Slices before killing Trilliax for Gluten Free.\n\n6. For A Change In Scenery, kill Spellblade Aluriel once at each required destination: Shal'dorei Terrace, Astromancer's Rise and Shattered Walkway. Reach the chosen area within 120 seconds and keep her there. Plan additional eligible difficulties/resets for the other destinations.\n\n7. For Star Augur's Elementalry!, bring and transform the required Nether Elemental through the encounter, defeat the resulting Well-Traveled Nether Elemental, then kill the boss. At Krosus, allow and quench 15 Burning Embers for Burning Bridges before finishing.\n\n8. At Tichondrius avoid all Echoes of the Void damage for Not For You. At Elisande trigger the Infinite Whelpling's betrayal and kill it before the boss for Infinitesimal.\n\n9. At Gul'dan let Eyes multiply until 16 can be killed together, then destroy the set within three seconds and finish the encounter for I've Got My Eyes On You. Avoid incidental damage before the eye pack is ready.\n\n10. Complete all 16 entries in Glory of the Legion Raider, claim Defiled Reins from its reward/mail and learn Grove Defiler. The removed Fruit of All Evil criterion and any guild achievements are not mount requirements.",
