        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Eighty world-quest completions spread over a rotating schedule, with possible PvP interference.\n\n1. Unlock Legion world quests through Uniting the Isles, then use a Alliance character. Stay out of a raid group and check which of the four free-for-all world quests is active before travelling.\n\n2. Operation Murloc Freedom, Azsuna around 37,16: complete its naga/murloc objectives 20 times over repeated appearances for Mission Accomplished. The repeat count is world-quest completions, not twenty creatures.\n\n3. Bareback Brawl, Stormheim around 61,27: weaken and ride the arena beasts as directed by the world quest; complete twenty appearances for Saddle Sore. Avoid simply one-shotting every mountable beast before using its interaction.\n\n4. Black Rook Rumble, Val'sharah around 38,45: complete the arena's active world-quest objectives twenty times for Off the Top Rook. The area is free-for-all; survival and nearby player activity can affect how long one completion takes.\n\n5. Darkbrul Arena, Highmountain around 51,77 (cave entrance near 53.5,76.2): defeat the relevant drogbar/players for the active world quest. Complete it twenty times for The Darkbrul-oh.\n\n6. When all four milestones complete, finish Free For All, More For Me and claim the faction's Prestigious War Mount reward. If the achievement completes but no mount arrives, check the journal and mail and report the missing reward rather than repeating arbitrary kills.",
