        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Requires Legion Leatherworking progression, a chase and soulbound Blood of Sargeras.\n\n1. Learn Legion Leatherworking from Namha Moonwater at 36.5,30.1 in Legion Dalaran, reach skill 100, and complete her profession quest chain until Mounting Made Easy becomes available. Preserve the profession; this harness cannot be bought from another crafter.\n\n2. Travel to the Great Northern Elderhorn in Stormheim near 62.6,23.5. Use the quest's lasso and follow the elderhorn along the chase route, keeping within range around cliffs and waterfalls. If the tether breaks, retrace the route and look for it before restarting the entire quest.\n\n3. Turn in Mounting Made Easy for Pattern: Elderhorn Riding Harness and learn the recipe.\n\n4. Collect 50 Stonehide Leather, 25 Blood of Sargeras and 10 Felhide. Craft Elderhorn Riding Harness and use it on your Leatherworker to learn the account-wide mount.",
