        reviewedAt = "2026-11-15",
        itemId = 138258,
        name = "Long-Forgotten Hippogryph",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=138258",
        sourceUrls = { "https://www.wowhead.com/item=138258" },
        mountCategory = "Treasure",
        sourceType = "Treasure",
        stepCount = 5,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Many possible hidden locations, an infrequent spawn round and competition.\n\n1. Travel to Azsuna with flight and a way to survive falls and water. Search for a purple clickable Ephemeral Crystal; ordinary mana decorations and Kosumoth's cave orbs are different objects.\n\n2. Click the first live crystal to begin the eight-hour Crystal Connection window. Stay on the same character and avoid dying. A clicked crystal can remain visible but become unclickable to you.\n\n3. Sweep the recorded Azsuna search locations for the other four distinct crystals. Check caves, tree bases, ruins, underwater spots and terrain below cliffs. Examples include Leyhollow at 50.55,20.40, the cave around 61,30, the academy water around 54.5,33.5 and Oceanus Cove's approaches. A pin can be empty because only a small set is active.\n\n4. Keep searching until five crystals are clicked within the window. If someone else finishes the round first, the crystals disappear and a new spawn round is needed. Avoid changing shards or travelling away mid-hunt; inconsistent old realm-hopping tricks are not required.\n\n5. After the fifth crystal, check your bags for Reins of the Long-Forgotten Hippogryph and learn it. If your connection expired or you died, begin a fresh set rather than looking for a rare hippogryph to kill.",
    },
