        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Repeated sewer activities and occasional free-for-all PvP exposure.\n\n1. Enter the Underbelly beneath Legion Dalaran. The achievement counts Sightless Eyes earned over time, not 20,000 held at once. Spend some before reaching the currency cap so further rewards still count.\n\n2. While guards patrol, kill and loot the sewer rare elites. Use Wild Mana Wands on elites for larger rewards, and fish in the Black Market area between spawns. Vendor items that summon enemies provide additional opportunities.\n\n3. When the guards leave, the Underbelly becomes free-for-all PvP and chests appear. Open chests if safe, or hire a bodyguard through Raethan to protect yourself. Changing War Mode does not remove the Underbelly's local PvP mechanic.\n\n4. Keep earning Eyes until Underbelly Tycoon completes. Claim Ratstallion from the achievement reward/mail and learn it. Spending Eyes on useful wands or other collection rewards does not erase earned credit.",
    },
