        reviewedAt = "2026-11-15",
        itemId = 138201,
        name = "Fathom Dweller",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=138201",
        sourceUrls = { "https://www.wowhead.com/item=138201" },
        mountCategory = "Quest Rewards",
        sourceType = "Quest Rewards",
        stepCount = 14,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - A long ordered secret with hidden underwater entrances and a rotating reward.\n\n1. Speak repeatedly to Drak'thul at 37.45,71.65 on the Broken Shore until he dismisses you. Bring underwater breathing, faster swimming and a hearth/teleport for the submerged caves.\n\n2. Enter Feldust Cavern near 58.5,54.0 on the Broken Shore. At the back, carefully mouse over the small dirt pile around 57.4,55.9 and loot the Weathered Relic. If the entrance appears rock-blocked, relog and check the correct cave approach.\n\n3. Return to Drak'thul, show the relic and keep reopening his dialogue until he has nothing more to say and tells you to go away. A single conversation is insufficient. Now click the following orbs in this exact order.\n\n4. Orb 1 - Azsuna, 37.96,37.39: enter the cave hidden by bushes at the tree's base. The orb is against a rock in the water at the back.\n\n5. Orb 2 - Stormheim, 32.83,75.70: enter the concealed cliffside cave behind purple-leaved bushes. The orb is in a pot of scrolls behind Kangaxx. Deal with the elite before reaching for it.\n\n6. Orb 3 - Val'sharah, 41.50,81.30: enter the tree-base cave, then turn left near the table into the concealed inner chamber. Find the orb on the floor beneath a root behind the enemy.\n\n7. Orb 4 - start at Broken Shore 31,75, then dive southwest toward the submerged entrance around 30,77 under the rectangular rock. Coordinates can switch maps in the Great Sea. Swim promptly through the fatigue section; inside, look beneath the tent among seaweed and avoid steam vents.\n\n8. Orb 5 - Azsuna, 59.37,13.08: enter the cave between large purple crystals. Look on the ground beside the broken table at the back.\n\n9. Orb 6 - Broken Isles continent map, 67.32,14.77, north of Shield's Rest: dive southeast below the wounded shark near the drowned statue. Enter the narrow opening and take the right passage. Reach the central orb between the damaging geysers. Do not enter these numbers as Stormheim coordinates.\n\n10. Orb 7 - Highmountain, 55.83,38.50: find the small bush-hidden opening to the right of the obvious large cave. The orb is beneath the more complete skeleton's skull at the back.\n\n11. Orb 8 - Azsuna, 54.05,26.21: enter the tree-base cave and look under the bush beside the rear pillar.\n\n12. Orb 9 - outdoor Eye of Azshara, 79.35,89.30: dive northeast to the sunken ship, swim through the seaweed-covered hull gap, then follow the internal passage into the cavern. The orb is at the back-right in shallow water. A smaller form can help fit through the wreck; watch your breath.\n\n13. Orb 10 - return to Drak'thul at Broken Shore 37.45,71.65 and click the orb on his table. Let his acknowledgement finish.\n\n14. Check the world quest for Kosumoth around 46.96,50.09 on the outdoor Eye of Azshara. When its reward is Fathom Dweller, defeat him and complete the world quest. If it offers Hungering Claw instead, wait for a later approximately two-week rotation; the attunement does not need repeating. Learn the awarded mount.",
    },
