        reviewedAt = "2026-11-15",
        itemId = 141217,
        name = "Leyfeather Hippogryph",
        wowheadUrl = "https://www.wowhead.com/item=141217",
        mountCategory = "Achievements",
        sourceType = "Achievements",
        stepCount = 12,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Several controlled mechanics and a five-player cross-dungeon requirement remain despite easy boss damage.\n\n1. Prepare a five-player group and identify each person's missing criteria in Glory of the Legion Hero. Plan the Black Rook Hold-to-Maw of Souls run for Poor Unfortunate Souls before using either dungeon's weekly boss opportunities.\n\n2. Eye of Azshara: kill Parjesh with every Hatecoil Shellbreaker alive (But You Say He's Just a Friend); collect at least 11 Saltsea Globules and destroy them with one Curse of the Witch at Lady Hatecoil (Stay Salty); avoid Magic and Frost Resonance at Wrath of Azshara (Ready for Raiding V).\n\n3. Darkheart Thicket: trigger and kill the Hatespawn Abomination during Dresaron before finishing Egg-cellent!; let Shade of Xavius reach ten Apocalyptic Empowerment stacks before killing him for Burning Down the House. Do not burst the boss at the pull.\n\n4. Neltharion's Lair: obtain the Ketchum Tablet and collect all seven named snail imprints for Got to Ketchum All; let Naraxas consume enough adds to reach six Ravenous stacks before killing her for Can't Eat Just One.\n\n5. Halls of Valor: splash all four kings with mead for I Got What You Mead, using the group to coordinate the throws; feed ten stags to a Storm Drake before killing it for Stag Party; interrupt every Stormforged Obliterator Surge while completing Odyn for Surge Protector.\n\n6. Assault on Violet Hold: when Festerface is selected, allow the Black Bile to appear and kill it before finishing I Made a Food!; when Millificent Manastorm is selected, trigger her very-cross state for You're Just Making It WORSE! Rotating boss selection can require another week's visit.\n\n7. Vault of the Wardens: reveal/free the Specter of Vengeance with Elune's Light (A Specter, Illuminated); at Cordana complete the airborne Creeping Doom movement without carrying the light for Who's Afraid of the Dark? Do not simply kill her before the mechanic.\n\n8. Black Rook Hold: wait for a Frustrated Soul at Amalgam of Souls and kill it before the boss (Black Rook Moan); read all six diary pages as they appear across runs (You Used to Scrawl Me In Your Fel Tome); keep Illysanna's allies alive while killing her (Adds? More Like Bads).\n\n9. Maw of Souls: rescue the Captured Val'kyr (Helheim Hath No Fury); let Ymiron's Defiant Strike kill six Risen Warriors (Instant Karma). For Poor Unfortunate Souls, all five players start in Black Rook Hold: click the blue spirit candle in the first room, clear within its 30-minute buff without dying, then reach Maw of Souls within the replacement ten-minute buff. Kill Ymiron to extend the timer, then Harbaron to gain Poor Unfortunate Soul. Defeat Helya while all five still have it; deaths remove the required state.\n\n10. The Arcway: avoid every Charged Bolt at Ivanyr (Arcanic Cling); collect the Nightwell Energy pools before any expire at Corstilax (Clean House); leave Timeless Wraiths alive while defeating Vandros (No Time to Waste).\n\n11. Court of Stars: wait for Gerdo to signal the watchposts before disabling all of them and killing him (Waiting for Gerdo); preserve the final conversation by approaching Melandrus after the spy sequence and waiting for the dialogue (Dropping Some Eaves).\n\n12. Finish the current 25 criteria, claim Reins of the Leyfeather Hippogryph from the achievement reward/mail and learn it. Balance of Power is needed for a related artifact tint, not for this mount.",
    },
