        tips = "",
        stepCount = 4,
        acquisition = "Difficulty: Medium - Requires 150 random-drop coins and waiting for the correct daily stock.\n\n1. Save 150 Curious Coins from Legion activities such as Broken Isles treasure, rares, dungeon bosses and emissary rewards. Avoid spending the coins on other Xur'ios items while saving for this mount.\n\n2. Visit Xur'ios at 48.8,13.4 in Legion Dalaran, outside behind the northern Bank of Dalaran near the Antonidas Memorial.\n\n3. Inspect his rotating stock for Arcadian War Turtle. If it is not offered, return after another daily reset; his permanent recipes being present does not mean the mount must be available.\n\n4. Buy Arcadian War Turtle for 150 Curious Coins and learn the item.",
